ian_id":"c32999aa-db0e-11ef-a209-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"汶港","place_name_jianti_auto":"汶港","place_note":"河南省汝南县东南","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"c32999ab-db0e-11ef-81dd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蔡州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蔡州","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"c32999ac-db0e-11ef-8a14-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"眞陽縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"真阳县","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"c32999ad-db0e-11ef-9db5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蕭梁","place_name_jianti_auto":"萧梁","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"c32999ae-db0e-11ef-8f69-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西淮州","place_name_jianti_auto":"西淮州","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"c32999af-db0e-11ef-b756-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"眞楊","place_name_jianti_auto":"真杨","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"c32999b0-db0e-11ef-bbdf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"白狗堆","place_name_jianti_auto":"白狗堆","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"c32999b1-db0e-11ef-85e8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"后齐","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"c32999b2-db0e-11ef-8f1a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊興郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐兴郡","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"c32999b3-db0e-11ef-81eb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"白狗縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"白狗县","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"c32999b4-db0e-11ef-88a3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"c32999b5-db0e-11ef-b027-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"懷州","place_name_jianti_auto":"怀州","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"c32999b6-db0e-11ef-a835-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"眞陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"真阳","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"c32999b7-db0e-11ef-bc3b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"眞陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"真阳","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"c32999b8-db0e-11ef-afad-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"汶水","place_name_jianti_auto":"汶水","start_index":72,"tongjian_id":"c32999b9-db0e-11ef-9e0c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"白狗、汶港二柵，皆在蔡州眞陽縣界。蕭梁置西淮州於眞楊陽白狗堆，後齊廢州爲齊興郡，尋廢郡爲白狗縣，隋開皇初改縣曰懷州，大業初省入眞陽。隋志：眞陽有汶水。","note_content_jianti_auto":"白狗、汶港二栅，皆在蔡州真阳县界。萧梁置西淮州于真杨阳白狗堆，后齐废州为齐兴郡，寻废郡为白狗县，隋开皇初改县曰怀州，大业初省入真阳。隋志：真阳有汶水。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"c32999a9-db0e-11ef-9b2c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"西平","place_name_jianti_auto":"西平","place_note":"河南省西平县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c32999bc-db0e-11ef-84ae-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"春秋","place_name_jianti_auto":"春秋","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"c32999bd-db0e-11ef-a8ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"柏國","place_name_jianti_auto":"柏国","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"c32999be-db0e-11ef-a59e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"c32999bf-db0e-11ef-9d11-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西平縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"西平县","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"c32999c0-db0e-11ef-a2cb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"汝南郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"汝南郡","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"c32999c1-db0e-11ef-ac4d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"c32999c2-db0e-11ef-a1fb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蔡州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蔡州","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"c32999c3-db0e-11ef-9850-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"西平，春秋柏國，漢爲西平縣，屬汝南郡，唐屬蔡州。九域志：在州西一百五里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"西平，春秋柏国，汉为西平县，属汝南郡，唐属蔡州。九域志：在州西一百五里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"c32999bb-db0e-11ef-a061-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"楚城","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚城","place_note":"汝南县西南","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c32999c6-db0e-11ef-b521-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"汝陽縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"汝阳县","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"c32999c7-db0e-11ef-85f0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蕭梁","place_name_jianti_auto":"萧梁","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"c32999c8-db0e-11ef-a13f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西楚州","place_name_jianti_auto":"西楚州","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"c32999c9-db0e-11ef-b8e2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"汝陽郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"汝阳郡","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"c32999ca-db0e-11ef-b278-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"楚城，在汝陽縣西南，蕭梁置西楚州及汝陽郡於此。","note_content_jianti_auto":"楚城，在汝阳县西南，萧梁置西楚州及汝阳郡于此。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"c32999c5-db0e-11ef-8f22-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"冶爐城","place_name_jianti_auto":"冶炉城","place_note":"河南省遂平县西北","resolved_place_entity_id":5968,"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"c32999ce-db0e-11ef-a6cb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/七、汝宁府（卷五十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"○慎阳废县，在县北四十里，自汉以来县皆治此。明改置今县]...","context_before":"...川。大业初，省入真阳。唐初复置淮川县，属息州。贞观初废。","source_end_index":161,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"ce9ff849-8c5b-5b9b-986d-8dfd83d55c7b","source_start_index":135,"source_text":"元和十二年，李愬攻蔡州，遣兵下白狗栅，即故白苟城也。"},{"context_after":"]。","context_before":"○汶港栅[在县东北汶水上。唐时淮西拒命，立栅于此。","source_end_index":51,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"4c9c2e5c-dec9-5350-8891-624b93621c32","source_start_index":25,"source_text":"元和十二年，李愬攻蔡，遣兵下白狗、汶港二栅，即其处也"},{"context_after":"]。","context_before":"○冶炉城[在县西七十五里。战国韩铸剑处。晋于此置铁官。","source_end_index":60,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"9332e9e6-e026-5051-8b70-cf5e68f633f3","source_start_index":27,"source_text":"唐元和十二年，李澺遣将破吴元济于嵖岈山，进取冶炉城，又破西平，是也"},{"context_after":"乾符三年，王仙芝党尚让据查牙山，官军退保邓州，黄巢寻自颍...","context_before":"...。又孔穴玲珑，风嘘则鸣，一名玲珑山。其东南十里曰马鞍山。","source_end_index":122,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"50bdbb49-24f9-500a-b07e-b7d003bec254","source_start_index":68,"source_text":"唐元和中，唐邓节度李愬遣将董少玢等分兵攻淮西，下马鞍山，拔路口栅，别将马少良等下查牙山，又进取西平之冶炉城。"},{"context_after":"]。","context_before":"...惠应之，攻拔永州，即此。隋州废，县属蔡州。大业末，县废。","source_end_index":348,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"05e4306c-7921-526b-9d2b-b71252250292","source_start_index":315,"source_text":"唐元和十二年，李愬攻蔡，遣兵破西平，别将王义又破楚城，即成阳故城矣"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/七、汝宁府（卷五十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"李愬山河十將嬀雅、田智榮下冶爐城。丙申，十將閻士榮下白狗、汶港二柵。癸卯，嬀雅、田智榮破西平。丙午，遊弈兵馬使王義破楚城。","content_fanyi":"李愬所部山河十将妫雅、田智荣攻下冶炉城。丙申日，十将阎士荣攻下白狗、汶港两座栅垒。癸卯日，妫雅、田智荣攻破西平。丙午日，游弈兵马使王义攻破楚城。","content_jianti_auto":"李愬山河十将妫雅、田智荣下冶炉城。丙申，十将阎士荣下白狗、汶港二栅。癸卯，妫雅、田智荣破西平。丙午，游弈兵马使王义破楚城。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":24257,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百四十 (唐紀五十六) / 憲宗昭文章武大聖至神孝皇帝中之下 / 元和十二年 / 第 19 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"c329999e-db0e-11ef-a3d3-a0d3651f611f","year_int":817},"tongjian_id":"c329999e-db0e-11ef-a3d3-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":1},"place_name":"冶爐城"},"message":"success","success":true}